      "source": [
        "# 案例 H4 / H5：跨单元格宏\n",
        "\n",
        "$\\def\\A{\\mathbf{A}}$\n",
        "$\\newcommand{\\R}{\\mathbb{R}}$\n",
        "\n",
        "本格使用：$u\\in\\R$，$\\A x$。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "metadata": {},
      "outputs": [],
      "source": [
        "# 代码格不提供宏\n",
        "# $\\newcommand{\\fromCode}{\\mathbf{Z}}$"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "后面格子应能用第一格的宏：$\\A u$，$x\\in\\R^n$。\n",
        "\n",
        "代码格的 `\\fromCode` 应为红字：$\\fromCode$\n",
        "\n",
        "H5：回到第一格追加 `$\\newcommand{\\nbFresh}{\\gamma}$`，这里写 `$\\nbFresh$`。"
      ]
    }
  ],
